# Episode 5: The Silent Phone

A young journalist vanished without warning.

Her phone stopped transmitting.

Her apartment showed no signs of forced entry.

Police suspected she left voluntarily.

Detective D. Torque disagreed.

The journalist had been working on an investigation.

Her computer contained notes about a secret network connecting several powerful people.

The final entry mentioned Victor Hale.

Torque traced the last signal from her phone.

The signal ended near an abandoned construction site.

A search uncovered a hidden room beneath the structure.

Inside were documents, photographs, and recording devices.

The journalist had gathered enough evidence to expose a major conspiracy.

She had been kidnapped before publishing her story.

Following clues from the recordings, Torque located the suspects and rescued her.

Several arrests followed.

Case Closed.

But the evidence pointed to a single mastermind.

Every trail now led to Victor Hale.

The game was almost over.
